# Git workflow

This is a solo repo. Work on `main` only.

- Commit and push directly to `main`.
- Do not create `cursor/*` (or other) feature branches, and do not open a PR, unless two independent changes must land at the same time or the user asks for a branch.
- If a previous agent left extra branches whose commits are already on `main`, delete those remote branches rather than stacking more of them.
- The GitHub default branch is `main`. Pages deploys from `main`.
